  "what": "problem PD-1@v1 drafted",
  "phase": "DISCOVER",
  "minute": 55.0,
  "event_seq": 108,
  "root_problem": "A gateway configuration change (CHG-77, 2026-09-09) disabled idempotency_key_enforcement on capture retries and was never rolled back (E-01). Steady-rate gateway-timeout retries (~120/day, E-02/E-05) are then sent to the PSP without an idempotency key, so the PSP stops deduplicating them and processes each retry as a new charge (E-03), which is why orders_with_2_captures jumped from 0 to tracking daily retry volume exactly from 09-09 onward (E-02) and double-charge tickets spiked ~27x the same week with flat order volume (E-04)."
 },
